# JOURNEY · the Shoal Counter, the sense that counts: a fish that lights while the tank holds
# more botfish than its threshold. over is count > threshold, which is why §12.3 needs two counters.
# Its panel walks by count: listens, drives, target, threshold, count, full, empty, over, under.

clear
include scenes/start-with-a-stake.play
include scenes/grow-a-matrixtank.play
include scenes/buy-at-the-bench.play "Shoal Counter" Senses
include scenes/take-a-fish.play botfish counter
include scenes/take-a-fish.play botfish crowd

run /consume shoal counter
key enter
absent to the botfishes

run /program "Counter"
key down 2
type botfish
key down
expect threshold
key backspace 2
type 1
key down 4
type crowd
snap the counter is set to count botfish and raise crowd past one
key enter
absent listens

run /program "Crowd"
type crowd
key enter

tick 3
run /circuit
key down
expect ●  Crowd
snap two botfish are more than one, so Crowd is lit
key esc
absent Circuit#
